---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Financial Disclaimer | EV Kelly Calculator"
  description="Critical risk warnings and financial disclaimers regarding the use of the EV Kelly Calculator."
>
  <div class="max-w-[900px] mx-auto w-full min-h-screen px-4 py-12 md:py-20 flex flex-col">
    
    <header class="flex flex-col items-center text-center mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <h1 class="animate-reveal text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-[var(--theme-accent-red)] mb-4" style="opacity: 0;">
        Financial Disclaimer
      </h1>
      <p class="animate-reveal delay-100 text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] font-medium" style="opacity: 0;">
        Effective Date: July 4, 2026
      </p>
    </header>

    <div class="liquid-panel static-panel w-full p-8 md:p-12 flex flex-col gap-8 bg-[rgba(255,69,58,0.02)] border-[rgba(255,69,58,0.2)]">
      
      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3 border-b border-white/10 pb-6">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">NOT FINANCIAL ADVICE</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          The tools, calculators, algorithms, and articles provided on evkellycalc.com are designed strictly for educational, mathematical, and informational purposes. We are not registered financial advisors, brokers, or wealth managers. <strong>No output from this tool is a recommendation to buy, sell, or hold any financial instrument.</strong>
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[var(--theme-accent-red)] tracking-tight">High Risk of Trading</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          Trading in financial markets—including equities, forex, cryptocurrencies, options, and futures—involves a high degree of risk and is not suitable for all investors. You could lose some or all of your initial investment. The Kelly Criterion is a theoretical mathematical formula; it completely ignores real-world execution friction such as slippage, broker commissions, liquidity gaps, emotional psychology, and "black swan" market events.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">No Guarantee of Accuracy</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[var(--theme-text-muted)] leading-relaxed">
          While we strive to ensure the absolute mathematical accuracy of our engine, we make no guarantees regarding the reliability, completeness, or absolute precision of the outputs generated by the calculator. You are solely responsible for conducting your own due diligence, backtesting, and verifying all formulas before allocating live capital.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="flex flex-col gap-3">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Total Absolution of Liability</h2>
        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-white font-medium leading-relaxed">
          By using this website, you explicitly agree that EV Kelly Calculator, its creators, and affiliates are completely absolved of any and all liability regarding your financial decisions. Your capital is your responsibility. Under no circumstances will we be held liable for trading losses, account blowups, or capital ruin resulting from the use of this service.
        </p>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>